= Instructions

Add the @Tequila{2 oz}, freshly squeezed @Lime juice{1/2 oz}, and pinch of @Salt{} to the glass, and fill with @Ice{}.

Top with chilled @Grapefruit soda{4 oz}, and stir briefly and gently to combine.

Garnish with a @Lime wheel{}.